# Auto-merge conflict avoidance for the branch -> main workflow
# (.github/workflows/auto-merge-claude.yml).
#
# The built-in `union` merge driver keeps BOTH sides' added lines instead of
# emitting conflict markers -- correct ONLY for append-only log files where
# concurrent sessions each append new entries at the tail.
#
# This repo currently has NO append-only log file, so there are no active
# `merge=union` entries below.
#
# Do NOT add `merge=union` for normal source files (Swift sources under
# Sources/, Package.swift, README.md, etc.): they are edited IN PLACE, and
# union would duplicate edited or whole-file content instead of resolving it
# correctly. Genuine concurrent edits to those files are REAL conflicts,
# which the workflow correctly routes to an "Auto-merge conflict: <branch>"
# PR instead of merging.
#
# If a NEW append-only log file is ever added, register it here, e.g.:
#   New_Append_Only_Log.md   merge=union
